  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICSP Programme, implemented by Tr&#xf3;caire and partners in the West Bank Area of Occupied Palestinian Territories-Israel, works towards the goal that duty-bearers will take actions to respect and protect peoples&apos; rights. This objective focuses on at-risk women and men survivors of rights violations and abuses, having increased access to justice. Activities include provision of legal advice and support for those at risk of access to justice violations.  The principal focus of this outcome is:
- Advocacy for the protection of human rights and access to justice
- Work under this outcome has a specific focus on women and women human rights defenders</narrative>
  </description>
